== 6. Next ===================================================== 
  Three things decide the next script: 
    1. whether any per-spot annotation exists (section 2) 
    2. whether the files are keyed by Visium ID (section 2) 
    3. how often RASSF9 is detected per spot (section 5) 
 
  If detection is low, the analysis becomes pseudobulk: sum counts 
  within each compartment within each patient, giving 18 paired 
  observations and a paired test -- far less powerful per spot but 
  robust, and the pairing is what makes it work. 
  no warnings raised 
